###  https://w3id.org/cerif2/instruments/Instrument_Instance#isInstanceOf
<https://w3id.org/cerif2/instruments/Instrument_Instance#isInstanceOf> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                                                       owl:inverseOf <https://w3id.org/cerif2/instruments/Instrument_Model#hasInstance> ;
                                                                       rdfs:domain :Instrument_Instance ;
                                                                       rdfs:range :Instrument_Model ;
                                                                       rdfs:comment "An Instrument Instance is an instance of a particular [Instrument Models](../entities/Instrument_Model.md). Even custom-developed instruments should have their Instrument Model."@en .


