                          rdfs:comment "Operating an [Instrument Instance](../entities/Instrument_Instance.md) or providing access to it on behalf of its [owner](../entities/Infrastructure_Ownership.md)."@en ;
                          rdfs:label "Infrastructure Operation"@en .


